#: src/features/setup/InstallStep.tsx
msgid "Readers sign in with their e-mail address on this server to write. Discussions start moderated: a reader's first post waits for you in Docs › Waiting for approval, later ones publish at once. Turn them off or open them to everyone in the inbox settings, under the site's channel."
